        if i % 2 == 0:
            sum += i
    print(sum)


Factorial
------------
Product of numbers from 1 to n is called factorial.

Example:

  n = 5
  Factorial = 120 (1×2×3×4×5)
  Program: Find factorial
  n = int(input('Enter any Number: '))
  fact = 1
  for i in range(1, n+1):
      fact *= i
  print('Factorial is:', fact)

